     -0.7566043*bore 0.7566043*bore   -0.8896725*bore 0.5944601*bore   -0.9885511*bore 0.4094713*bore   -1.0494403*bore 0.2087466*bore
     -1.07*bore 0   -1.0494403*bore -0.2087466*bore   -0.9885511*bore -0.4094713*bore   -0.8896725*bore -0.5944601*bore
     -0.7566043*bore -0.7566043*bore   -0.5944601*bore -0.8896725*bore   -0.4094713*bore -0.9885511*bore   -0.2087466*bore -1.0494403*bore
